Test Materials (prototype/tests/*.musicxml)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The repository currently contains three MusicXML files under prototype/tests/:

  - bwv66_6.musicxml
  - bwv66_with_rehearsal.musicxml
  - bwv66_with_clarinet.musicxml

Technical observation (not a rights determination):
  Pitch sequences of these files match music21 corpus data associated with
  BWV 66.6. It is therefore likely that the encodings derive from that
  corpus family. This is a technical origin finding, not a conclusion about
  license, ownership, or permission to redistribute.

The value of the MusicXML <creator> element is not used here to determine
the composer or rights holder.

